Developer Manual

Short summary:
This is a Vite + React + TypeScript single-page application with Tailwind CSS for styling.

Key technologies:
- Framework/build: Vite, React 18, TypeScript
- Styling: Tailwind CSS (tailwindcss-animate), PostCSS, autoprefixer
- UI / Components: Radix UI primitives, shadcn-style components (lovable-tagger present), lucide-react
- State / Data & Forms: @tanstack/react-query, react-hook-form, zod
- Routing & Charts: react-router-dom, recharts
- Tooling & Tests: ESLint, Vitest (jsdom), Playwright (lovable config)
- Build/Dev plugins: @vitejs/plugin-react-swc
- Utility libs: clsx, date-fns, sonner, tailwind-merge

Project files of interest:
- package.json (dependencies & scripts)
- vite.config.ts (Vite config with React SWC plugin and component tagger)
- tailwind.config.ts (Tailwind setup and theme extensions)
- tsconfig.json (TypeScript config and path aliases)
- vitest.config.ts (Vitest setup)
- playwright.config.ts (Playwright / lovable config)
- src/ (application source code)
- public/ (static assets)

Notes:
- Uses TypeScript but allows some non-strict flags (see tsconfig.json).
- Component tagging (lovable-tagger) is enabled in development via Vite config.
- Tailwind content includes src, pages, and components folders.

Keep this file updated when adding major frameworks, testing tools, or CI changes.